WEBVTT

00:33:59.360 --> 00:34:02.226
because people are afraid to seek support.

00:34:02.250 --> 00:34:05.876
At South Metro, like in many
emergency-response organizations,

00:34:05.900 --> 00:34:08.666
people felt like they were
supposed to be tough.

00:34:08.690 --> 00:34:10.976
Chris experienced
that lack of support firsthand

00:34:11.000 --> 00:34:15.096
20 years ago, in the aftermath
of the Columbine High School shooting,

00:34:15.120 --> 00:34:17.236
where he was a first responder.

00:34:17.260 --> 00:34:21.056
CM: The old science
was make you go to a debriefing

00:34:21.080 --> 00:34:24.786
with people you didn't know,
allowing visitors in the room,

00:34:24.810 --> 00:34:27.036
and then, really, people
asking you questions

00:34:27.060 --> 00:34:30.136
and wanting you to tell your whole story
right there on the spot.